ADDITIONAL NOTICE: This software prepares firmware images for flashing to
Mac Pro hardware. Flashing a boot ROM can permanently damage ("brick") the
machine. This software does not flash hardware itself, does not guarantee that
any prepared image is safe to flash, and is used entirely at your own risk.
Always keep an untouched backup of your original firmware and a hardware
recovery path before flashing.
